# Build context is the repository root. Send only what the Dockerfile needs:
# the pip requirements and the package manifests of the workspace (for rosdep).
# Sources, build artifacts, datasets and assets stay out of the image.
*
!docker/requirements-arena.txt
!docker/rosdep-skip-keys.txt
!docker/nvidia-extra
!arena4_ws/src/**/package.xml
!arena4_ws/src/**/COLCON_IGNORE
!arena4_ws/src/**/AMENT_IGNORE
!arena4_ws/src/**/CATKIN_IGNORE

# Packages hidden from rosdep. Keep in sync with packages-skip in
# colcon-defaults.yaml.
# - ROS 1 (catkin) packages inside imported repos
arena4_ws/src/deps/hunav/people_msgs/leg_detector/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/hunav/people_msgs/face_detector/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/hunav/people_msgs/people/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/hunav/people_msgs/people_tracking_filter/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/hunav/people_msgs/people_velocity_tracker/**
arena4_ws/src/arena/simulation-setup/entities/robots/boxer/**
arena4_ws/src/arena/simulation-setup/entities/robots/husky/**
# - Gazebo Classic / Fortress simulator packages (Arena uses Harmonic and only
#   needs the robot descriptions from these repos)
arena4_ws/src/deps/robots/irobot_create/irobot_create_gazebo/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/robots/irobot_create/irobot_create_ignition/**
arena4_ws/src/gazebo/turtlebot4_simulator/**
arena4_ws/src/deps/nav2/navigation2/nav2_system_tests/**
